  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Thinly slice tomato into half-moons. Roughly chop cucumber and kalamata olives.\n• Thinly slice red onion (see ingredients). Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8171f18d6e477003fc9c7/step-66e8b900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Toast pearl couscous and garlic, stirring occasionally, until golden and fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Carefully half-fill the saucepan with water, then add a pinch of salt.\n• Simmer, uncovered, until tender, 14-16 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and return to the pan with a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8171f18d6e477003fc9c7/step-47fa0110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine the vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Scrunch sliced onion in your hands, then add it to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover onion. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8171f18d6e477003fc9c7/step-aa1e1a20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the couscous is cooling, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side (cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8171f18d6e477003fc9c7/step-fce42030.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain the onion.\n• To the couscous, add tomato, cucumber, onion, olives, dried cranberries, spinach & rocket mix (see ingredients) and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8171f18d6e477003fc9c7/step-6c542340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide olive pearl couscous between bowls.\n• Top with haloumi and drizzle with creamy pesto dressing to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8171f18d6e477003fc9c7/step-61923550.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
